  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* label each x, and ask whether it localizes ON ITS OWN *)\ngoodCols = Select[Range[dtot], Mod[#, d2] == 0 &];\nbadCols = Complement[Range[dtot], goodCols];\nvanish[i_] := Select[Range[-1, Max[Λ[1]]], (xs[[i]] . Normal[Bop[θ[1] + h #]]) === ConstantArray[0, dtot] &];\nlab[trip_] := Union[{trip[[2, 1]], trip[[1, 1]], trip[[2, 2]] - 1}];\nlabels = Table[First[Select[pats, lab[#] === vanish[i] &]], {i, Length[W1]}];\nlocQ = Table[xs[[i, badCols]] === ConstantArray[0, Length[badCols]], {i, Length[W1]}];\nsummary = SortBy[Table[{labels[[i]][[2, 1]], labels[[i]][[1, 1]], labels[[i]][[2, 2]],\n     labels[[i]][[1, 1]] == labels[[i]][[2, 2]], locQ[[i]]}, {i, Length[W1]}], {#[[1]], #[[2]]} &];\nGrid[Prepend[summary, {\"m12\", \"m11\", \"m22\", \"m11==m22\", \"localizes alone\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
